  "description": "In-process SurrealDB transport for Disruptor.Surface, backed by RocksDB via SurrealDb.Embedded.RocksDb. Side-steps the HTTP /rpc body-size ceiling that bites on large commits (code-index full rebuilds, bulk imports). Process-local single-writer mutex around transactional commits keeps the WriterLease CAS contract honoured even when multiple threads share the same client.",
